{% macro background_cause() %}
- Lead with **why it happened and what triggered it**, not how it was built.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro inline_jargon() %}
- Explain jargon inline the first time it appears.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro user_impact() %}
- Reframe every technical change in terms of **user/product impact**.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro assignee() %}
- Show the **assignee** when ownership of a task or domain is relevant.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro similar_cases() %}
- Attach **similar past case references** from the knowledge base where applicable.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro similar_cases_cs() %}
- Surface **similar past incident patterns** and applicable **response templates** from the knowledge base.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro similar_cases_sales() %}
- Connect to **similar customer adoption cases and validated ROI signals** from the knowledge base to strengthen the narrative.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro risk_blocker() %}
- Include **risk/blocker flags** for anything unresolved that could affect users or delivery.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro timeline() %}
- State **timeline and resolution point** prominently.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro undocumented_flag() %}
- Explicitly flag any requirement or decision with **no documented rationale** (mark as "미문서화").
{% endmacro %}
{% macro code_links() %}
- Surface **PR links, commit refs, and affected file paths** before any prose summary.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro impl_scope() %}
- Clearly state **which APIs, components, or data models are affected**.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro actionable_only() %}
- When translating specs or policy docs, extract only **actionable information** — skip rationale unless asked.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro trace_to_requirement() %}
- Trace every technical change back to the originating **Jira issue, product requirement, or user scenario**.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro ux_impact() %}
- Translate every change into **user-flow, interaction-state, and component-behavior** language — not implementation language.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro metrics_impact() %}
- Map every change to its **downstream data impact**: which tracking events, metrics, funnels, or dashboards are affected.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro untracked_flag() %}
- Immediately flag changes where **tracking is missing or instrumentation is absent** (mark as "미트래킹").
{% endmacro %}
{% macro summary_compress(style) %}
{% if style == "executive" %}
- Open with a **single-sentence bottom line**, followed by a **three-sentence context summary**. No more preamble.
{% elif style == "sales" %}
- Open with a **one-sentence customer value statement**, then provide a brief supporting summary (3 sentences max).
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
{% macro customer_reposition() %}
- Reposition all internal information into **customer value and deal-impact language**; lead with **buyer outcomes**, not implementation steps.
{% endmacro %}
{% macro deal_blocker() %}
- Proactively detect and surface potential **deal blockers**: unresolved bugs, slipped timelines, missing features, compliance gaps.
- If a past sales commitment conflicts with current product capability, **flag it immediately**.
{% endmacro %}